{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"core","version":"v1","id":"utilities/overview","title":"Core utilities","description":"Find the runtime helpers for reading values, selecting steps, building actions, and diagnosing integrations.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The core package exposes utilities beyond defining a form. Use this section when\nbuilding shared controls, custom workflows, adapters, or tooling around an instance."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"choose-a-utility-by-task"},"children":["Choose a utility by task"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:table","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Task"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Read"]}]]}]},{"tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Extract raw answers or resolve nested field paths"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"values-and-paths.md"},"children":["Values and paths"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Parse a route step or transform step keys"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"step-selection.md"},"children":["Step selection"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Share validated domain actions and selected context"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"helper-functions.md"},"children":["Helper functions"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Build reusable setters, patches, and resets"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"action-factories.md"},"children":["Action factories"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Generate labels and transform casing"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"labels-and-casing.md"},"children":["Labels and casing"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Read, write, and remove stored drafts"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"storage-and-lifecycle.md"},"children":["Storage and lifecycle"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Log operations and handle typed errors"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"diagnostics.md"},"children":["Diagnostics"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Compose callable APIs or construct resolved data"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"composition.md"},"children":["Low-level composition"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Extract and transform public types"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"type-utilities.md"},"children":["Type utilities"]}]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Resolve dates, validation, and overrides"]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"dates-and-resolution.md"},"children":["Dates and resolution"]}]}]]}]]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["All imports in this section come from ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["@jfdevelops/multi-step-form-core"]},".\nThe React package re-exports selected action utilities, but not every core helper.\nImport core helpers from core rather than assuming all packages share an entry point."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"choose-a-level-of-abstraction"},"children":["Choose a level of abstraction"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Start with an instance's bound methods when targeting a running form. Use\nstandalone helpers for reusable algorithms, and low-level constructors only when\nyou need to own the surrounding validation, notification, and persistence behavior."]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Reading an answer does not subscribe a view. Reading a storage object does not\nupdate a mounted instance. Likewise, creating a context object does not create a\nsecond form. Keep the owner of state explicit when combining these utilities."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"next-steps"},"children":["Next steps"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"values-and-paths.md"},"children":["Read values and paths"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"step-selection.md"},"children":["Select steps safely"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"../../../react/v1/utilities/overview.md"},"children":["React utility hooks"]}]},"\n"]]}],"toc":[{"title":"Choose a utility by task","url":"#choose-a-utility-by-task","depth":2},{"title":"Choose a level of abstraction","url":"#choose-a-level-of-abstraction","depth":2},{"title":"Next steps","url":"#next-steps","depth":2}]}